    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Stream</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And You're Tonight's Star</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just when you're about to watch your favorite streamer, you realize something is off.\u00a0 The house he is looking at, <i>it's yours</i>, and he just broke in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, hide until the cops come, find a way to escape your house, without running away on foot, for his &quot;accomplices&quot; hides in the bushes. Check the stream to find out where the Streamer is at, read chat while in a closet, if that's what you're into.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several mid game events to spice up the survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Endings to achieve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls:\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Click: Open/Close Doors; Hide in closets and curtained bathtubs; Interact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right Click: Watch the stream</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift: Sprint</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ctrl (or C): Crouch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E: Pick Up/Pickpocket Items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F: Flashlight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X/Y:\u00a0<i>Lean</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203420/extras/6f2430d0e9b96800b8acda9f38bb2874.poster.avif?t=1744481761\" width=250 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203420/extras/6f2430d0e9b96800b8acda9f38bb2874.webm?t=1744481761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203420/extras/6f2430d0e9b96800b8acda9f38bb2874.mp4?t=1744481761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Additional information about what's in the game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a one map game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A killer to avoid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A puzzle to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of items to pick up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of hiding spots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is an internal timer in game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Stream</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And You're Tonight's Star</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just when you're about to watch your favorite streamer, you realize something is off.\u00a0 The house he is looking at, <i>it's yours</i>, and he just broke in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, hide until the cops come, find a way to escape your house, without running away on foot, for his &quot;accomplices&quot; hides in the bushes. Check the stream to find out where the Streamer is at, read chat while in a closet, if that's what you're into.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several mid game events to spice up the survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Endings to achieve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls:\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Click: Open/Close Doors; Hide in closets and curtained bathtubs; Interact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right Click: Watch the stream</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift: Sprint</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ctrl (or C): Crouch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E: Pick Up/Pickpocket Items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >F: Flashlight</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X/Y:\u00a0<i>Lean</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203420/extras/6f2430d0e9b96800b8acda9f38bb2874.poster.avif?t=1744481761\" width=250 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203420/extras/6f2430d0e9b96800b8acda9f38bb2874.webm?t=1744481761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3203420/extras/6f2430d0e9b96800b8acda9f38bb2874.mp4?t=1744481761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Additional information about what's in the game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a one map game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A killer to avoid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A puzzle to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of items to pick up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of hiding spots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is an internal timer in game.</p>",
